<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρυώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exuding a watery fluid,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκος δ. καὶ ἀνεκπύητον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			; <i>running</i> at the eyes, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>tear-like,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συρροή,</span> of the bulbils of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίνον</span> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.6.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tearful, lamentable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
